{
  "text": "On the authority of the mother of the faithful, Umm Abdullah Aisha, may Allah be pleased with her, who said, The Messenger of Allah, may the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, said, He who innovates something in this matter of ours, that is not of it, will have it rejected. It was related by al-Bukhari and Muslim. In one version by Muslim it reads, He who does an act which our matter is not in agreement with will have it rejected.",
